ContractLabourApp-Mac.zip
└── ContractLabourApp/
    ├── run.command        ← double-click launcher
    ├── venv/             ← full Python runtime + deps
    ├── app/              ← your project files
    └── data/

1️⃣ Create isolated runtime folder
From your project root: 
    mkdir mac_bundle
    python -m venv mac_bundle/venv
    source mac_bundle/venv/bin/activate
    pip install -r requirements.txt

2️⃣ Copy your app into bundle
   mkdir mac_bundle/app
   cp -R app.py transformers repositories utils data mac_bundle/app/

3️⃣ Create Mac launcher
  Create file:
  mac_bundle/run.command
    #!/bin/bash
  DIR="$(cd "$(dirname "$0")" && pwd)"
  source "$DIR/venv/bin/activate"
  cd "$DIR/app"
  streamlit run app.py

Make it executable:
   cd mac_bundle
   ./run.command

Browser should open with your app.

5️⃣ Create client ZIP
   cd ..
  zip -r ContractLabourApp-Mac.zip mac_bundle


